Package: devjam-kde-servicemenus
Version: 1.37-3
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: meld, imagemagick, k4dirstat, kfind, kdialog, kompare, mediainfo, konsole, dolphin, krusader, thunar, pacpl, devjam-tools, fclones, inotify-tools, zstd, genisoimage, kio-admin, mkvtoolnix, ffmpeg
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Dolphin and Krusader service menus by devjam
 Service menus for Dolphin and Krusader to convert audio and video,
 compare files and folders (Meld, Kompare, diffoscope, fclones), check
 FLAC files, show media information, identify images, pack archives, PDFs
 and DVD ISO images, monitor a folder for activity, open a folder as root
 or in Konsole, copy paths, and build .deb packages. Most actions call
 scripts from devjam-tools.
